      "title": "Meta launches Muse Wonder with computer use and sub-agent delegation",
      "summary": "Meta released Muse Wonder on Vercel AI Gateway and Muse Code. Meta designed the 1M-token model for coding, computer use, multi-step task planning, and delegating to sub-agents.",
      "design_implication": "When an autonomous agent stalls mid-task, interfaces usually force users to start over. Models that coordinate sub-agents and recover from execution errors allow designers to replace manual resets with supervisory checkpoint views, shifting the interaction from linear prompts to delegated task oversight.",
