          "claim": "Meta released Muse Wonder on Vercel AI Gateway designed for computer use and multi-step tasks",
          "quote": "Muse Wonder now available on AI Gateway. The model is designed for coding, long-running agents, and computer use. It can plan multi-step tasks, delegate work to sub-agents, and recover from errors as work progresses."
